{
  "category": "Blimp Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "It’s drowzy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in big groups. No one knows where they go.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It carries people and Pokémon when it flies. But since it only drifts, it can end up anywhere.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "At dusk, swarms of them are carried aloft on winds. When noticed, they suddenly vanish.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can generate and release gas within its body. That’s how it can control the altitude of its drift.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can generate and release gas within its body. That’s how it can control the altitude of its drift.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
      "text": "At dusk, swarms of them are carried aloft on winds. When noticed, they suddenly vanish.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "At dusk, swarms of them are carried aloft on winds. When noticed, they suddenly vanish.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "They carry people and Pokémon, but the wind can catch them, so there can’t be a fixed destination.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "They carry people and Pokémon, but the wind can catch them, so there can’t be a fixed destination.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "It carries people and Pokémon when it flies. But since it only drifts, it can end up anywhere.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s drowsy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in big groups. No one knows where they go.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "It carries people and Pokémon when it flies. But since it only drifts, it can end up anywhere.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s drowsy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in big groups. No one knows where they go.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "There was once an incident in which a man took a trip riding a Drifblim, only to go missing.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even while under careful observation, large flocks of Drifblim flying at dusk will inexplicably disappear from view.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "There’s a rumor that if you catch a Drifblim floating on the wind at dusk, you’ll be carried away to the afterlife.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "The raw material for the gas inside its body is souls. When its body starts to deflate, it’s thought to carry away people and Pokémon.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Some say this Pokémon is a collection of souls burdened with regrets, silently drifting through the dusk.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It grabs people and Pokémon and carries them off somewhere. Where do they go? Nobody knows.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "It drifts along at dusk, perfectly silent. Its transient, melancholy aspect touches some people deeply—every so often, one will come upon a song or poem devoted to Drifblim.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
